<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells manganese ore.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells manganese ore.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold 2,000 short dry tons of metallurgical grade manganese ore to Cameron Chemical Co of Virginia for an approximate market value of $91,000.</p>
<p>The next date for offers is February 4.</p>
<p>((New York Commodities 212-859-1646))</p>
